# A HarnessTrim OpenCode install, which is a per-developer choice here rather than part of the
# product. `harnesstrim install opencode` writes its own `.opencode/.gitignore` covering
# `node_modules`, `package.json` and `package-lock.json`, but deliberately leaves the generated
# wrapper trackable so a team can share one reduction setup. This repository does not: contributors
# pick their own harnesses, and a committed wrapper would hand every one of them a reducer on
# OpenCode. Drop this entry to share the setup instead.
.opencode/

